abstract: >-
  R code, input parameter table and summary results for a Monte Carlo
  comparison of a Venus cloud-level aerostat colony and a Mars surface
  colony across radiation, water and oxygen cost, exports, colony net
  present value and gravity-linked health, with an H2O deep learning
  surrogate, permuted-refit variable tests and PERMANOVA.
